  characterName: Alpha
  characterDescription: "A Shadowling who has gone through constant tribulations
    and evolutions, turning them into an apex predator.\r\nTheir aimless wandering
    has turned them into a simple brute, relying on pure strength to tear all in
    its path. Do not underestimate its brutality, for it has learned the concept
    of \u201CCornered beast\u201D at the very least.\r\nAlthough their maturity has
    hindered their evolution, it is not yet dormant and will activate once in a while.\r\n"
